{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 33,
  "name": "天山遁",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04770",
              "text": "遯：亨，小利贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04770",
                "bodyParagraph": 4706
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04771",
              "text": "【白话】《遯卦》象征退避：亨通，小事能够成功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04771",
                "bodyParagraph": 4707
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04772",
              "text": "《象》曰：“天下有山，遯；君子以远小人，不恶而严。”",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04772",
                "bodyParagraph": 4708
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04773",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《遯卦》的卦象是艮（山）下乾（天）上，为天下有山之表象，象征着隐让退避。因为山有多高，天就有多高，似乎山在逼天，而天在步步后退，但天无论怎样后退避让，却始终高踞在山之上。君子应同小人保持一定的距离，以傲然不可侵犯的态度截然划清彼此的界限，这样一来，就自然而然会生出一种震慑住小人的威严来。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04773",
                "bodyParagraph": 4709
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04775",
              "text": "遁卦乾上艮下，天在山上；阴长阳消，外界形势不利时，君子以退避自全。此处的“遁”不是无原则逃避，而是审时度势、保存实力、远离不当人事。《序卦》说“物不可以久居其所，故受之以遁。遁者，退也”。山的“止”与天的“健”结合，说明能止其所当止，才有将来重新行动的可能。事业、经商均宜少进多守，既不与小人同流合污，也不因名利而迟疑不决；退避时修养能力，等待转机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04775",
                "bodyParagraph": 4711
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04778",
              "text": "初六，遯尾；厉。勿用有攸往。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04778",
                "bodyParagraph": 4714
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04779",
              "text": "【白话】初六，隐退避让错过时机落在了后边，情况非常不好。面对这种情形，应该静观待变而不要有所行动，否则将会更加不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04779",
                "bodyParagraph": 4715
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04780",
              "text": "《象》曰：遯尾之厉，不往何灾也？",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04780",
                "bodyParagraph": 4716
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04781",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：错过隐退避让的时机却还要隐退就会带来祸患，但是静观不动就不会造成什么危害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04781",
                "bodyParagraph": 4717
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04783",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04783",
                "bodyParagraph": 4719
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04785",
              "text": "初六爻动，变为第13卦《同人卦》（天火同人）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04785",
                "bodyParagraph": 4721
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04787",
              "text": "初六为“遁尾”，逃得太迟而落在后面，处境危险。既错过主动退避的时机，就不宜慌忙妄动，以守住眼下安全为上。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04787",
                "bodyParagraph": 4723
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04790",
              "text": "六二，执之用黄牛之革，莫之胜说。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04790",
                "bodyParagraph": 4726
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04791",
              "text": "【白话】六二，像用黄牛的皮捆绑起来那样，谁也难以解脱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04791",
                "bodyParagraph": 4727
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04792",
              "text": "《象》曰：执用黄牛，固志也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04792",
                "bodyParagraph": 4728
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04793",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“像用黄牛的皮捆绑起来那样”，意思是说，要坚定自己的志向，决不因任何情况而动摇。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04793",
                "bodyParagraph": 4729
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04795",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04795",
                "bodyParagraph": 4731
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04797",
              "text": "六二爻动，变为第44卦《姤卦》（天风姤）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04797",
                "bodyParagraph": 4733
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04799",
              "text": "六二“黄牛之革”形容捆缚牢固，象征意志坚定、不轻易被环境牵引。所要坚持的是合乎正道的信念，而不是不分情况地固执。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04799",
                "bodyParagraph": 4735
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04802",
              "text": "九三，系遯，有疾厉，畜臣妾，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04802",
                "bodyParagraph": 4738
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04803",
              "text": "【白话】九三，由于被牵累而难以远去，就像疾病缠身那样危险。处在这情况下，就要畜养仆人和侍妾，要使他们被我所用，只有这样，才能转危为安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04803",
                "bodyParagraph": 4739
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04804",
              "text": "《象》曰：“系遯之厉”，有疾惫也。“畜臣妾吉”，不可大事也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04804",
                "bodyParagraph": 4740
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04805",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“由于被牵累而难以远去，会有危险”，因为在这种想退而又不能退的情况下，就像疾病缠身那样使人疲惫不堪。“畜养仆人和侍妾就会吉祥”的意思是说，处在有所系累的情况下，是不可能有什么大作为的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04805",
                "bodyParagraph": 4741
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04807",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04807",
                "bodyParagraph": 4743
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04809",
              "text": "九三爻动，变为第12卦《否卦》（天地否）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04809",
                "bodyParagraph": 4745
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04811",
              "text": "九三“系遁”显示受人事或感情牵累，进退两难，如患病般疲惫。可处理小规模事务，但不宜承担重大行动，尤其要与不良关系保持距离。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04811",
                "bodyParagraph": 4747
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04814",
              "text": "九四，好遯，君子吉，小人否。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04814",
                "bodyParagraph": 4750
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04815",
              "text": "【白话】九四，可以从容隐退避让而无所系累。君子将因此而获得吉祥，小人却不会吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04815",
                "bodyParagraph": 4751
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04816",
              "text": "《象》曰：“君子好遯，小人否也。”",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04816",
                "bodyParagraph": 4752
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04817",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：君子能够做到该退就退，从容自如，而小人却做不到这一点。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04817",
                "bodyParagraph": 4753
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04819",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04819",
                "bodyParagraph": 4755
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04821",
              "text": "九四爻动，变为第53卦《渐卦》（风山渐）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04821",
                "bodyParagraph": 4757
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04823",
              "text": "九四“好遁”说明能及时舍弃私欲、名利，明知何时应退。君子当退则退而吉；小人贪恋眼前利益，往往错失退避良机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04823",
                "bodyParagraph": 4759
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04826",
              "text": "九五，嘉遯，贞吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04826",
                "bodyParagraph": 4762
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04827",
              "text": "【白话】九五，能够进退自如地隐退避让，能坚守正道，其结果是吉祥的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04827",
                "bodyParagraph": 4763
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04828",
              "text": "《象》曰：“嘉遯，贞吉”，以正志也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04828",
                "bodyParagraph": 4764
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04829",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“能够自如地隐退避让，坚守正道将会获得吉祥”，关键是要坚定自己的信念和志向。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04829",
                "bodyParagraph": 4765
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04831",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04831",
                "bodyParagraph": 4767
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04833",
              "text": "九五爻动，变为第56卦《旅卦》（火山旅）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04833",
                "bodyParagraph": 4769
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04835",
              "text": "九五“嘉遁”高于单纯自保，是在责任已有安排、进退自如的情况下退身，合乎中正之志。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04835",
                "bodyParagraph": 4771
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04838",
              "text": "上九，肥遯无不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04838",
                "bodyParagraph": 4774
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04839",
              "text": "【白话】上九，既无牵累，又已远离，早已处在隐退避让中，就像是远走高飞一样，所以无论这时做什么，都不会有什么不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04839",
                "bodyParagraph": 4775
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04840",
              "text": "《象》曰：“肥遯无不利”，无所疑也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04840",
                "bodyParagraph": 4776
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-04841",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：之所以它能够“随心所欲地远走高飞而又无不利”，就在于它所做的一切都是理所当然和自然而然的，没有什么疑虑和思索选择的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04841",
                "bodyParagraph": 4777
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04843",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04843",
                "bodyParagraph": 4779
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04845",
              "text": "上九爻动，变为第31卦《咸卦》（泽山咸）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04845",
                "bodyParagraph": 4781
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-04847",
              "text": "上九“肥遁”，象征脱离牵累后自由从容，因没有疑惧而无往不利。古人以远走高飞比喻功成身退，仍可关心天下而不被私利束缚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-04847",
                "bodyParagraph": 4783
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
